  "title": "They Called Them Monsters… Until the Real Monsters Awakened | BEASTBOUND Season 1",
  "description": "They threw him into an arena to die.<br><br>Then dragon blood entered his wounds… and everything changed.<br><br>Kade was just another slave, forced to fight for the entertainment of an empire. But when a dying dragon awakens something forbidden inside him, he becomes the one thing the Empire cannot control.<br><br>Now hunted for the power in his blood, Kade joins a mysterious siren, a fierce dragonborn warrior, a beastkin fighter, and a powerful giant.<br><br>Five outcasts. One fight for freedom.<br><br>Together, they escape the arena, cross dangerous seas aboard a pirate ship, battle dragon riders, encounter colossal sea creatures, and discover a forgotten world beneath the ocean.<br><br>But something far more terrifying is waiting in the depths.<br><br>And even the monsters are afraid of it.<br><br>⚔️ <b>*BEASTBOUND — SEASON 1*</b><br><br>Experience the first season of an epic dark fantasy adventure filled with dragon transformations, brutal arena battles, pirate warfare, ancient mysteries, underwater kingdoms, and legendary creatures.<br><br>They called them monsters.<br><br>Then the real monsters woke up.<br><br>🔥 If you enjoy dark fantasy, dragon battles, powerful transformations, and cinematic adventures, subscribe and join us for the next chapter of BEASTBOUND!<br><br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/beastbound\">#BEASTBOUND</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/darkfantasy\">#DarkFantasy</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/dragonfantasy\">#DragonFantasy</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/fantasyseries\">#FantasySeries</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/epicfantasy\">#EpicFantasy</a>",
